<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cossack problems may drag on-Woodside.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cossack problems may drag on-Woodside.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas producer Woodside Petroleum Ltd said on Wednesday production problems at its Cossack Pioneer production vessel offshore Western Australia might not be resolved until 1997.</p>
</text>
